+// TargetBitrateKbps is this peer's send-side bandwidth estimate for its VIDEO transport, or 0 when
+// there is nothing trustworthy to report (no estimator, or the connection is not up yet — GCC's
+// pre-feedback value is just the configured initial bitrate and must not be mistaken for a measurement).
